Hi {Owner},

I build websites and tour booking systems for senior living communities around {City}. Looking at {Business Name} the way an adult child would on a weeknight, I found floor plans as PDFs, 'call for pricing' and no way to book a tour online.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: floor plans with availability, independent, assisted and memory care explained, honest monthly ranges, a current activities calendar and online tour booking, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

Resident photos and stories only appear with written consent. A build like this runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, calendar and menu updates and privacy-safe forms.

Would thirty minutes with you and your sales director be worthwhile?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
